---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
// The independence claim — load-bearing trust block on every Decision
// Library page + the sales hub. One consistent placement: after the answer
// block, before deep content.
// [OPERATOR: confirm the claim is true as worded — it constrains future
// dealer deals. If a dealer agreement is ever signed, this component and
// every page carrying it must be revisited.]
---

<aside class="neutrality" aria-label="Why our advice is neutral">
  <Icon name="shield" size={22} />
  <div>
    <strong>Why our advice is neutral:</strong>
    We're not tied to any manufacturer, any leasing program, or any national
    chain. We don't carry inventory we need to move. Our sizing and pricing
    guidance is just math — which is why it's worth trusting.
    <a href="/how-we-work/">How we work →</a>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .neutrality {
    display: flex; gap: var(--space-3); align-items: flex-start;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--navy);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    margin: var(--space-6) 0;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .neutrality svg { color: var(--navy); flex: none; margin-top: 2px; }
  .neutrality strong { color: var(--navy); }
</style>
